        ("How much does it cost?",
         "<p>All fees are fixed, quoted up front and in full before any decisions are made, so there are no hidden charges or unpleasant surprises later on. There are no hourly charges, and any like-for-like quote is matched.</p><p>If any necessary additional work is identified later (which is rare), you'll be told first so you can decide whether it should go ahead.</p>"),
